# Jira sync pipeline artifacts: raw pulls and auto-derived clustering
# output, both regenerated fresh on every sync run (see
# app.jobs.jira_sync.runner) -- not app source, not meant to be
# committed. Manual corrections belong in the DB (project_overrides,
# people.team_guessed), not in these regenerated files.
backend/jobs/jira-sync/cache/
backend/jobs/jira-sync/generated/

.claude/settings.local.json

# Standalone app snapshots / sibling experiments kept only in the local
# working copy -- each is its own git repo (with its own .env.local), so
# letting git track them would embed bare gitlinks at best.
/team-pulse-54/
/summit-read/
/engineering-ethos/

# Saved output of ad-hoc GitHub API debugging calls
